# 统一行尾：源码一律 LF（跨平台一致），批处理 CRLF
# ★ 立此文件的来由：第三方复核 P1-4 —— 仓库 CRLF / 工作树 LF 会在 clone 后产生永久 diff 噪声
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

# 二进制（不做行尾转换）
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mov  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.ply  binary
